      <div class="hope-tag">"Rest is not a luxury — it's a necessity"</div>
      <a href="/blog/coping-with-stress" style="color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none;">Read More →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-card">
      <h3>Building Healthy Relationships</h3>
      <p style="color: #666;">Tips for nurturing strong, healthy connections with others...</p>
      <div class="hope-tag">"Connection is the antidote to isolation"</div>
      <a href="/blog/healthy-relationships" style="color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none;">Read More →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-card">
      <h3>Self-Care for Mental Health</h3>
      <p style="color: #666;">Practical self-care strategies for better mental well-being...</p>
      <div class="hope-tag">"Self-care is not selfish — it's survival"</div>
      <a href="/blog/self-care" style="color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none;">Read More →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-card">
      <h3>Grief and Loss</h3>
